WEBVTT

00:00:27.283 --> 00:00:30.363
in the few coming minutes.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:36.179
Let me take you back two years ago in my life.

00:00:36.179 --> 00:00:39.135
It was the bedtime of my son, Aboody.

00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:41.819
He was five at the time.

00:00:41.819 --> 00:00:44.259
After finishing his bedtime rituals,

00:00:44.259 --> 00:00:48.341
he looked at me and he asked a question:

00:00:48.341 --> 00:00:51.572
"Mommy, are we bad people?"

00:00:51.572 --> 00:00:54.032
I was shocked.

00:00:54.032 --> 00:00:57.189
"Why do you say such things, Aboody?"

00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:59.524
Earlier that day, I noticed some bruises

00:00:59.524 --> 00:01:02.107
on his face when he came from school.